- Add suite cases for the rebind and the re-probe, each with a planted mutant.\n   - Update the design banner at `hdl/srp/KL_srp_listener_fsm.sv:67-71`, which documents the old trade-off.\n2. **#189:** GET_RX_STATE's REGISTERING_FAILED follows the registered declaration type on every change, including the in-place Advertise↔Failed swap in both directions, with no state transition added (Milan v1.2 5.5.3.5.44 Table 5.39). Add a suite case and a planted mutant.\n3. Run every processor gate at base and head. Run the parent consumer gates on a scratch parent at milan-fpga dev e9cbb676 with your head committed locally as the gitlink, plus the parent patches `parent-evidence-classification.patch` (#180) and the milan_dp section #67 patch (#176).\n4. STOP on any register-map, top-level port or parameter change.\n\nPut your receipts in the output directory, with an index generated from the files present. Post REVIEW READY or STOP on #188.\n","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/comments/6256482476/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/comments/6256505724","html_url":"https://github.com/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/188#issuecomment-6256505724","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/188","id":6256505724,"node_id":"IC_kwDOT06kyc8AAAABdOqzfA","user":{"login":"Mister-M-alt","id":161579364,"node_id":"U_kgDOCaGBZA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161579364?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt","html_url":"https://github.com/Mister-M-alt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/follo